#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:8
msgid "线格式"
msgstr "Wire Format"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:10
msgid ""
"Wire 版本为 `1`。除特别说明外，整数字段使用小端序。帧布局为 `基本帧头 | TLV | 载荷 | 可选认证标签 | 整帧 CRC16`。基本帧头为 24 字节；`header_len` 包含所有 "
"TLV，最大为 255。"
msgstr ""
"The wire version is `1`. Integer fields are little-endian unless explicitly stated otherwise. A frame is"
" `base header | TLVs | payload | optional authentication tag | frame CRC16`. The fixed header is 24 "
"bytes; `header_len` includes all TLVs and is at most 255."

