#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:30
msgid ""
"节点零无效；`0xFFFF` 表示广播。DATA、ACK、CONTROL 的类型分别为 `1`、`2`、`3`。Wire 拒绝其他报文类型。DATA_TYPE "
"使用独立扩展，因此应用类型不会被误当作控制报文。端点准入拒绝可靠广播，非可靠广播仍受路由及认证策略约束。"
msgstr ""
"Node zero is invalid; `0xFFFF` is broadcast. DATA, ACK and CONTROL use types `1`, `2` and `3`, "
"respectively. Wire rejects all other packet types. DATA_TYPE is a separate extension, so an application "
"type cannot accidentally become a control packet. Reliable broadcast is rejected at endpoint admission; "
"unreliable broadcast remains subject to routing and authentication policy."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:32
msgid "标志与流量类别"
msgstr "Flags and Traffic Class"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:34
msgid "标志位 `0x01` 表示请求确认，`0x02` 表示含扩展，`0x04` 表示含认证标签，`0x08` 标记控制帧。未分配的标志位必须为零。"
msgstr ""
"The flag byte uses `0x01` for ACK elicitation, `0x02` to indicate extensions, `0x04` to indicate an "
"authentication tag, and `0x08` for control. Unassigned flag bits must be clear."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:36
msgid "流量类别低三位表示优先级，第 6–7 位表示可靠性。取值 `0x00` 表示不请求确认，`0x40` 表示请求确认，`0x80` 表示纯 ACK。第 3–5 位未分配，必须为零。"
msgstr ""
"The traffic-class byte uses bits 0–2 for priority and bits 6–7 for reliability. The supported "
"reliability values are `0x00` (none), `0x40` (ACK eliciting) and `0x80` (ACK only). Bits 3–5 are "
"unassigned and must be clear."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:38
msgid "扩展标志仅在 `header_len > 24` 时置位。报文类型决定合法的可靠性取值、标志和帧头字段。"
msgstr ""
"The extension flag is set exactly when `header_len > 24`. The packet type determines the permitted "
"reliability value, flags and header fields."

