#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:47
msgid "校验与编号"
msgstr "Validation and Numbering"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:49
msgid ""
"两种 CRC 均为 CRC-16/MODBUS，结果按小端编码。帧头 CRC 覆盖 24 字节基本帧头，计算时将第 22、23 字节置零。整帧 CRC 覆盖其前的所有字节，包括 TLV "
"和认证标签。解码器校验完整边界、精确的载荷及标签长度，以及 DATA_TYPE、SESSION、SECURITY 的单例约束，然后才返回借用视图。完整帧解码与逐步流解析共用 Wire 的字段、长度与 CRC "
"校验。版本字段必须为 1。结构合法的未知非关键 TLV 可被跳过。认证标志只表明携带标签，认证是否有效由安全模块判定。"
msgstr ""
"Both CRCs use CRC-16/MODBUS and are encoded little-endian. Header CRC covers the 24-byte header with "
"bytes 22 and 23 zeroed. Frame CRC covers every preceding frame byte, including TLVs and the "
"authentication tag. The decoder validates complete boundaries, exact payload/tag lengths and DATA_TYPE, "
"SESSION and SECURITY singleton constraints before returning borrowed spans. Complete-frame decoding and "
"incremental stream parsing share Wire field, length and CRC checks. The version field must be `01`. "
"Structurally valid unknown noncritical TLVs are skipped. A wire-authenticated flag indicates a tag is "
"present; only security verification establishes authenticity."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:51
msgid ""
"每个 peer scope 的可靠 DATA 从零开始，仅在首次发送被接纳后递增；重传保持包号。可用 DATA 编号止于 `UINT32_MAX - 1`；发送和接收均拒绝可靠 DATA 使用 "
"`UINT32_MAX`，接收历史不会回绕到零。ACK、CONTROL、非可靠 DATA 的帧头包号为零，被确认的包号只出现在 ACK_RANGE 或 SACK 中。可靠序号耗尽前必须切换到新 epoch。"
msgstr ""
"Reliable DATA starts at packet number zero per peer scope and increments only after accepted initial "
"submission. Retransmission preserves it. Usable DATA numbers end at `UINT32_MAX - 1`; both sending and "
"receiving reject `UINT32_MAX` for reliable DATA, so receive history cannot wrap to zero. ACK, CONTROL "
"and unreliable DATA encode zero; acknowledged numbers occur only inside ACK_RANGE or SACK. A connection "
"must move to a new epoch before the reliable sequence is exhausted."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:53
msgid "大小预算"
msgstr "Size Budget"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md:55
msgid ""
"载荷预算为 `MTU - 24 - TLV 字节数 - 标签字节数 - 2`。携带单区间 ACK、SESSION、SECURITY 和 16 字节标签的 ACK 长度为 `24 + 15 + 14 + 15 "
"+ 16 + 2 = 86` 字节。128 字节控制预留可容纳该示例。当前 Boot 构建不包含认证；此处是线格式预算，不表示认证 Boot 也能放进相同 RAM 配置。"
msgstr ""
"Payload budget is `MTU - 24 - TLV bytes - tag bytes - 2`. A single-range ACK with SESSION, SECURITY and "
"a 16-byte tag uses `24 + 15 + 14 + 15 + 16 + 2 = 86` bytes. A 128-byte control reservation accommodates "
"that example. Current Boot builds omit authentication; the example is a wire budget, not a claim that "
"authenticated Boot fits the same RAM configuration."

